00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Configure company pages, search terms, and filters. Then let Junior run on your machine, your browser, and your IP.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Download Junior 3.0. One month of Enterprise free with code JUNIOR3ENT through September 9.
